# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
*.egg-info/

# Runtime / user data — never publish
data/
temp/
temp_pdfs/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# Original / backup screenshots — local-only, not for publish
docs/screenshots-backup/

# NSIS installer build output (CI rebuilds it; winsw.exe/nssm.exe stay tracked)
packaging/windows/jt-doc-tools-*-setup.exe

# Maintainer-internal code-signing notes (not for public repo).
# 萬用字元，不要逐檔列 —— SIGNPATH-LICENSE-CHANGE.md 就是因為這裡只列了
# APPLICATION 那一檔，自 v1.15.8 起被公開了四天（裡面有 Organization ID，
# 而 CI 是把它當機密存的）。守門 tests/test_signpath_notes_are_private.py。
packaging/windows/SIGNPATH-*.md
# **任何目錄底下**的 SignPath 筆記都擋 —— 綁在單一路徑上的規則，只要有人把
# 筆記放到別的資料夾就又公開一次（同一個病換一個維度：上次漏的是檔名）。
SIGNPATH-*.md
